d_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"k1-3XZUKemdtDPeej9KI7A","review_id":"9LFJxj3_V0baKmsN_exj5g","date":"2018-05-10T18:24:32","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9412299394607544,"text_excerpt":"Great place for wine and snacks in the lower garden district! The tasting room is adorable, a great spot to go with friends or on a date. I loved that there are comfy couches, tables, or seats in the window so you can pick the spot that works best for the vibe you're going for. They have a large selection of wines and the people working were really knowledgeable about what they had available. They also let us have samples of other wines that they were considering adding into their wine flights (!!!!) My friend and I shared a cheese plate and the truffle fries and they were both really good! I wish they had given us more bread with the cheese plate but maybe I just like bread too much. The..."},{"business_id":"k1-3XZUKemdtDPeej9KI7A","review_id":"UKYQXxdJ9Wme2N7x5j1-zA","date":"2015-05-05T19:12:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9356443881988525,"text_excerpt":"This place is awesome. The food is great and the staffs knowledge of wine was impressive. Very nice for a date night. Definitely try the crab cakes."},{"business_id":"k1-3XZUKemdtDPeej9KI7A","review_id":"gQ2nUKkQ3vEnqTD6KkDA_A","date":"2018-10-06T16:37:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9354172945022583,"text_excerpt":"I have to say I was impressed with this place. The service was great and the wine selection is interesting and well thought out. The ambience has a kewl vibe going for it too. We all did flights and thought it was a great way to go. I'll defiantly be back and have to sample some of their food to go along with the wine."}],"visual":[{"bu